{#
  module/Schoenstatt/view/schoenstatt/assignments/advanced-search.phtml, ported.

  Four fields over the same `searchEntities()` the simple search calls, plus the shared
  assignments table.

  **There is no `</form>`.** The .phtml opens the form and never closes it, so every
  element below — the table included — is inside it, and the browser closes the tag at
  `</body>`. Reproduced rather than repaired: this is a port, the rendering is identical
  in every browser, and `form_close()` here would be a one-line change to shipped markup
  that the baseline diff would then report on every locale.

  **The option translator is off for three selects and on for the fourth.** The .phtml
  calls `formSelect()->setTranslatorEnabled(false)`, renders search/associationKind/
  associationCountry, turns it back on, then renders roleTitle — its comment says "we
  want roleTitle translated". `form_row`'s second argument is that switch. Kind and
  country labels are already-translated data (AssociationKindsService, the ISO country
  list); role titles are source strings that live in the phrase table.

  `personName` and `onlyMainRoles` are defined on the form and **not rendered** — the
  .phtml lists four rows and stops. Left unrendered, since a field the original does not
  show is a field nobody has ever submitted from this page.
#}
{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block page_stylesheets %}
        <link href="/css/selectize.bootstrap3.css" media="screen" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
{% endblock %}

{% block page_scripts %}
        <script src="/js/gen-schoenstatt-advanced-search.js"></script>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
{%- set are_results = objects is not null and objects|length > 0 -%}
{{ form_open(form, '') }}

<div class="row">
{{ form_row(form.get('search'), false) }}
{{ form_row(form.get('associationKind'), false) }}
{{ form_row(form.get('associationCountry'), false) }}
{{ form_row(form.get('roleTitle')) }}
</div>
<div class="form-group ">
{{ form_submit(form.get('submit')) }}&nbsp;{{ form_button(form.get('clear')) }}</div>

{% if are_results %}
{% include 'schoenstatt/_assignments-table.html.twig' with {
    'assignments': objects,
    'columns': ['association', 'role', 'person', 'email', 'telephone'],
} only %}
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
